      "id": 231,
      "start": 493.32,
      "end": 494.32,
      "en": "My final price.",
      "zh": "我的最终价格。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 494.32,
      "end": 494.63,
      "en": "$100 for both.",
      "zh": "两个一共100美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 495.32,
      "end": 496.81,
      "en": "That's two for the price of one and that's my last offer.",
      "zh": "这就是买一送一，这是我的最终报价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 497.32,
      "end": 498.32,
      "en": "Great.",
      "zh": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 498.32,
      "end": 502.92,
      "en": "You've got a deal.",
      "zh": "成交！"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 502.92,
      "end": 503.07,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 503.92,
      "end": 505.91,
      "en": "In Canada, it's not really common to bargain, right?",
      "zh": "在加拿大，讨价还价并不常见，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 506.4,
      "end": 507.4,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 507.4,
      "end": 508.4,
      "en": "It really isn't.",
      "zh": "真的不是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 508.4,
      "end": 513.96,
      "en": "Even when you go to the market to buy fruits and vegetables, it's very, very rare to bargain with a shopper.",
      "zh": "即使你去市场买水果和蔬菜，和商家讨价还价也是非常罕见的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 514.19,
      "end": 515.4,
      "en": "How about in Ecuador?",
      "zh": "在厄瓜多尔怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 515.51,
      "end": 515.79,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 515.93,
      "end": 517.03,
      "en": "In Ecuador, you definitely bargain.",
      "zh": "在厄瓜多尔，你绝对讨价还价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 517.4,
      "end": 518.4,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 518.4,
      "end": 522.45,
      "en": "Well, if you go to the mall, for example, or if you go to a supermarket, of course, you wouldn't really bargain.",
      "zh": "好吧，例如，如果你去商场，或者如果你去超市，你当然不会真的讨价还价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 523.2,
      "end": 528.81,
      "en": "Unless maybe you go to a small store or you go to one of the local markets, then it's more common to bargain.",
      "zh": "除非你去一家小商店，或者你去当地市场之一，否则更常见的是讨价还价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 529.64,
      "end": 531.84,
      "en": "You have to because people expect you to bargain.",
      "zh": "你必须这样做，因为人们希望你讨价还价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 532.24,
      "end": 533.24,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 533.24,
      "end": 536.12,
      "en": "In many countries in the world, bargaining is almost like an art.",
      "zh": "在世界上许多国家，讨价还价几乎就像一门艺术。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 536.3,
      "end": 536.76,
      "en": "Yeah, that's true.",
      "zh": "对，确实如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 537.12,
      "end": 541.08,
      "en": "Actually, Marco, you are an excellent bargainer, aren't you?",
      "zh": "实际上，Marco，你是一个出色的讨价还价者，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 541.14,
      "end": 541.58,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 541.86,
      "end": 544.16,
      "en": "I've been known to bargain with the shopkeepers.",
      "zh": "众所周知，我会与店主讨价还价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 544.72,
      "end": 548.86,
      "en": "I've been known to bargain a little bit with the shopkeepers and helping out.",
      "zh": "众所周知，我会与店主讨价还价并提供帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 549.04,
      "end": 549.56,
      "en": "A little bit.",
      "zh": "有一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 550.04,
      "end": 553.52,
      "en": "I mean, you've got better prices than I can even imagine getting.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，你的价格比我想象的要好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 553.52,
      "end": 553.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 553.82,
      "end": 555.08,
      "en": "That's a good story.",
      "zh": "这个故事很不错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 555.52,
      "end": 559.92,
      "en": "Maybe we'll get JP to go to our comment section and tell you about that.",
      "zh": "也许我们让 JP 到评论区来讲讲这个故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 559.92,
      "end": 560.92,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 560.92,
      "end": 561.96,
      "en": "So we want to know about your countries.",
      "zh": "所以我们想了解你的国家。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 561.96,
      "end": 562.8,
      "en": "Is it common to bargain?",
      "zh": "讨价还价是常见的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 563.08,
      "end": 563.82,
      "en": "Do you really do it?",
      "zh": "你真的做到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 563.98,
      "end": 564.42,
      "en": "Is it okay?",
      "zh": "可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 565.08,
      "end": 566.06,
      "en": "Or when is it okay?",
      "zh": "或者什么时候可以？"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 566.38,
      "end": 566.58,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 566.8,
      "end": 567.0,
      "en": "Tell us.",
      "zh": "告诉我们吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 568.36,
      "end": 570.4,
      "en": "Visit our website at EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "访问我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 570.4,
      "end": 576.3,
      "en": "Tell us about your country's bargaining customs and also leave your questions there for us.",
      "zh": "告诉我们您所在国家的讨价还价习俗，并把您的问题留在那里给我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 576.56,
      "end": 576.72,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 577.56,
      "end": 577.98,
      "en": "We'll be there to answer them.",
      "zh": "我们会在那里回答他们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 578.56,
      "end": 579.5,
      "en": "But until then, we've got to go.",
      "zh": "但在那之前，我们得走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 579.56,
      "end": 580.56,
      "en": "So, bye.",
      "zh": "所以，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 580.56,
      "end": 589.349,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
